---
// Minimal Privacy Policy — required by Google Ads for landing pages.
const updated = 'June 2026';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Privacy Policy | La Jolla Martial Arts</title>
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex,follow" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32.png" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Archivo:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style is:global>
    :root { --bg:#fdfbf5; --ink:#141414; --muted:#5a5a5a; --red:#b9121b; --line:#ecebe7; }
    * { box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0; }
    body { font-family:'Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif; background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink); line-height:1.65; }
    .wrap { max-width:760px; margin:0 auto; padding:3rem 1.25rem 4rem; }
    .logo { height:50px; margin-bottom:2rem; }
    h1 { font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif; font-size:2.6rem; text-transform:uppercase; }
    .upd { color:var(--muted); font-size:0.9rem; font-style:italic; margin-bottom:1.6rem; }
    h2 { font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif; font-size:1.5rem; text-transform:uppercase; margin:1.8rem 0 0.5rem; }
    p { color:#333; margin-bottom:0.9rem; } a { color:var(--red); }
    .back { display:inline-block; margin-top:2rem; color:var(--red); font-weight:700; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <img class="logo" src="/assets/LJ-martial-arts-logo.PNG" alt="La Jolla Martial Arts" />
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="upd">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <p>This Privacy Policy explains how La Jolla Martial Arts (“we,” “us”) collects and uses information when you submit a form on our landing pages or website.</p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>When you request a free trial, we collect the information you provide — your name, phone number, email address, and the program you’re interested in. We also collect limited technical data (such as referral source and ad click identifiers like gclid) to measure our advertising.</p>

    <h2>How We Use It</h2>
    <p>We use your information to contact you about your free trial, schedule classes, respond to your questions, and improve our marketing. We do not sell your personal information.</p>

    <h2>Who We Share It With</h2>
    <p>We share information only with service providers that help us operate — for example, our CRM and email automation tools (GoHighLevel) and advertising/analytics providers (Google). These providers process data only on our behalf.</p>

    <h2>Communications</h2>
    <p>By submitting a form, you agree to receive emails and text messages about your trial. You can opt out at any time by replying STOP to texts or unsubscribing from emails.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:LJBULLYPROOF@GMAIL.COM">LJBULLYPROOF@GMAIL.COM</a>, call <a href="tel:8583610961">(858) 361-0961</a>, or visit us at 7680 Girard Ave, La Jolla, CA 92037.</p>

    <a class="back" href="/lp/kids-martial-arts">← Back</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
